= RDF test data: N-Triples (.nt)

Only the synthetic project fixture remains here. The collected N-Triples samples
(DBpedia, EasyRdf, W3C test suite / ORG ontology) were migrated to the
graph-test-data repo under text/n-triples/.

ddot.it/this ..format.. format:n-triples

# Synthetic project fixture
sp-multi-literal.nt ..kind.. synthetic
sp-multi-literal.nt ..format.. format:n-triples
sp-multi-literal.nt ..content.. same subject+predicate (dcterms:created/modified on org#) repeated with multiple date-typed object literals
sp-multi-literal.nt ..tests.. multiple object literals for one subject-predicate pair, xsd:date typed literals
sp-multi-literal.nt ..authored by.. Calpano / graphinout
sp-multi-literal.nt ..license.. not stated (public domain unless otherwise stated)
